<title>JAPAN: Technol Eight - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Technol Eight - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  5.82		vs	    5.49</p>
<p> Operating	  317 million	 vs	   91 million</p>
<p> Current	    326 million	 vs	   83 million</p>
<p> Net		  128 million	 vs	   62 million</p>
<p> EPS		   10.82 yen	  vs	    5.25 yen</p>
<p> Shares		12 million	 vs	   12 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  5.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Technol Eight Co Ltd manufactures pressed car parts.</p>
